# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBenefit
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBenefit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBenefit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBenefit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#AccessStructure> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBenefit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBenefit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accumulated benefit of a hypothetical index: sum of its records. After its real index is removed it starts again from -hasEstimatedCreationCost and counts only the executions after the removal (Morelli, section 3.3)."@en .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBenefit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has accumulated benefit"@en .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBonus
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBonus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBonus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBonus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#AccessStructure> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBonus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBonus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Accumulated benefit of a real index (Morelli, section 3.2): hasInitialAccumulatedBonus + the RealIndexBonus and IndexUpdateCost records of the executions after its creation (or after its last rebuild). Below -hasEstimatedCreationCost the index is removed (or rebuilt)."@en .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAccumulatedBonus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has accumulated bonus"@en .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateColumnSize
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateColumnSize> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateColumnSize> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateColumnSize> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Heuristic> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateColumnSize> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateColumnSize> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bytes assumed for each aggregate column of a view (sum, avg, count...) in SizeRowVM."@en .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateColumnSize> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has aggregate column size"@en .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateExpression
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateExpression> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasAggregateExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Clause> .
