<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cost estimated by the optimizer for a query or subquery without hypothetical structures (getExecutionCostQuery). Set by the dispatcher; for an executed statement the real plan of the execution is used instead."@en .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has estimated cost"@en .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCreationCost
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCreationCost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCreationCost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCreationCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#AccessStructure> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCreationCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCreationCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CCI = 2P + c R log2 R (Salles, 2002, section 4.5.1): read the P pages of the table and write the same number of index pages, plus sorting the R tuples. In plan cost units (one page I/O = 1). Copied to the real index when it is created; -CCI is its elimination threshold."@en .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedCreationCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has estimated creation cost"@en .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedScanCost
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedScanCost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedScanCost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasEstimatedScanCost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#HypotheticalMaterializedView> .
