<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasExpectedPageReadCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#float> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasExpectedPageReadCount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "QPL used by the expectation heuristic: the pages read by that execution (hasPageReadCount), or the hypothetical pages of the view when the plan does not have them, as in the SWRL rule of Oliveira (figure 4.11)."@en .
