# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasIOCPUCostCoefficient
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasIOCPUCostCoefficient> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
