# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateHypotheticalIndex
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#isPerformedBy> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Function_CreateHypotheticalIndex> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "create hypothetical index % on %(%);" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "As the index is no longer beneficial to the database (Benefit: % x Creation cost: %), it was removed and kept only in the metabase." .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealIndex
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
