<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#isPerformedBy> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Function_CreateRealIndex> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "create index % on %(%);" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "The index has an estimated benefit of %, which exceeds its estimated creation cost of %. Statements that generated the benefits: %." .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealMaterializedView
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealMaterializedView> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
