<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealMaterializedView> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDBADecision> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealMaterializedView> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "create materialized view %" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealMaterializedView> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "The hypothetical materialized view has an estimated positive benefit of %, which in absolute value exceeds its estimated creation cost of %." .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_CreateRealMaterializedView> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#wasExecuted> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropHypotheticalIndex
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action> .
