<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "drop hypothetical index %;" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropHypotheticalIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "As the index proved beneficial to the database (Benefit: % x Creation cost: %), it was removed as hypothetical and created as a real index in the database." .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropRealIndex
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropRealIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
