<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropRealIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "drop index %;" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_DropRealIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "The index has an estimated negative benefit of %, which in absolute value exceeds its estimated creation cost of %. Statements that caused the losses: %." .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#isPerformedBy> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Function_RealMaterializedView> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDBADecision> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "This materialized view has an estimated benefit of <MaterializedView.accumulatedBenefit>, which exceeds its estimated creation cost of <MaterializedView.creationCost>. Statements that generated the benefits: <MaterializedView.benefitedStatements>" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewBenefitsHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#wasExecuted> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#isPerformedBy> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Function_HypotheticalMaterializedView> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDBADecision> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "The SQL query <Query> was rewritten to make it generic and usable by other queries with the same structure but different parameters. As a consequence, the hypothetical materialized view with the following syntax was suggested: <DDL Create View>" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewCandidatesHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#wasExecuted> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#isPerformedBy> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Function_RealMaterializedView> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDBADecision> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "This materialized view has an estimated execution cost of <MaterializedView.estimatedExecutionCost>, while the original query costs <Query.executionCost>. Therefore, the estimated saving each time the materialized view is used may be <MaterializedView.executionGain>" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_MaterializedViewExpectationHeuristic> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#wasExecuted> "false"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_RebuildRealIndex
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_RebuildRealIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_RebuildRealIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_RebuildRealIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#isPerformedBy> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Function_RebuildRealIndex> .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_RebuildRealIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasDescription> "alter index % set (fillfactor = %); reindex index %;" .
<http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#Action_RebuildRealIndex> <http://www.owl-ontologies.com/onDBTuning.owl#hasJustification> "The accumulated bonus of the index, %, is below its elimination cost, %, but the index is fragmented (GrF %) and was useful in % scans: rebuild it with fill factor % instead of dropping it." .
